--
^warning: ignoring
static assertion failed
--
A fold over an alias template's pack was left unexpanded in the alias's
specialization, and the C type checker's fallback for a residual fold made
it `true': decltype of the fold was bool.  With Xcode 26's libc++,
std::__math::copysign<double, double> returned bool and lost its body
(125 tests failed on the macOS 26 CI job).
